OL,3,GNEWSAMan in critical condition after
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in a critical condition with
OL,7,Fserious head injuries after an assault
OL,8,Fin Ashford, police have said.
OL,10,FKent Police said emergency services
OL,11,Fwere called to Lower High Street
OL,12,Fshortly after 05:10 BST, where the man
OL,13,Fwas found injured near a water fountain
OL,14,Fand St Johns Lane alleyway.
OL,16,FThe man, aged in his 30s, was taken by
OL,17,Fambulance to a London hospital, the
OL,18,Fforce said.
OL,20,FA police cordon was put in place
OL,21,Fbetween Wellesley Road and North Street
OL,22,Fwhile officers carried out inquiries.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
